# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# The GitHub download holds only what the plugin runs (the keep-list from the
# `keep-the-download-to-what-runs` rule). The first two lines leave out every top-level
# entry, dot-entries included; each `-export-ignore` line after them puts one back.
/* export-ignore
/.* export-ignore

# What the plugin runs.
/uamswp-acf-maskfield.php -export-ignore
/fields -export-ignore
/assets -export-ignore

# Kept on purpose: the licenses (the field class is MIT-licensed code that must travel with
# its notice, in LICENSE-MIT.md) and the plugin readme that carries the stable tag.
/LICENSE -export-ignore
/LICENSE-MIT.md -export-ignore
/readme.txt -export-ignore
